== relation push-forwards (Schroedinger) of the card maps; must equal Clifford conjugation labels
  swap0 {'XA': 'ZA', 'ZA': 'XA', 'XB': 'XB', 'ZB': 'ZB'}
  swap1 {'XA': 'XA', 'ZA': 'ZA', 'XB': 'ZB', 'ZB': 'XB'}
  couple {'XA': 'XA*XB', 'ZA': 'ZA', 'XB': 'XB', 'ZB': 'ZA*ZB'}
  all card maps symplectic: True
== K-G1 (fixed words; never tuned): W6 = (swap_A, couple)^3 then read q_B ; W7 = W6 + swap_A
  cards              W6 -> {0: '1'}   W7 -> {0: '1'}
  QM (calibration)   W6 -> {1: '1'}   W7 -> {1: '1'}
  cards: state after W7 equals initial state: True
